msgid "Clinical SME, l1-extraction-reviewer, programme manager, business analyst, FHIR modeller, terminologist; the smart-guideline-end-to-end skill says which signs each stage. Each adjudication calls cat-harness's generic review (Process_Review) on the staged preview (feature-staging, staging-review) and records a qa-review/v1 Decision (approve, request-changes, reject) with the adjudicator's role id. A rejection files a bean against the stage and marks every asset derived from the rejected item rejected-upstream; it does not stop the agent."
msgstr "Clinical SME, l1-extraction-reviewer, programme manager, business analyst, FHIR modeller, terminologist; the smart-guideline-end-to-end skills which signations each stages. Cada adjudicación llama a la revisión genérica de cat-harness (Process_Review) en la previsualización escenificada (feature-staging, stading-review) y registra una decisión qa-review/v1 (aprobación, cambios en la solicitud, rechazo) con el id de rol del juez. Un rechazo presenta un frijol contra la etapa y marca cada activo derivado del ítem rechazado; no detiene al agente."

